# Phase 5 lifecycle, L-U4 (cli-ledger): the help fx v0.0.16 prints for
# `fx update`, the alias it added for `fx upgrade` (`commands.zig:242`), beside
# upgrade's own and the top-level row that names both, so the parity row of the
# deferred `upgrade` says what fx does there. The release host is the fake
# gateway, which answers 404, so nothing is downloaded or installed even if a
# help flag were not honoured.
env FX_AUTO_UPGRADE=0
env FX_E2E_UPGRADE_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:@PORT@
wait 3
keep
type /quit
key Enter
wait 2
relaunch update --help
wait 3
snapfull h00-update-help
relaunch upgrade --help
wait 3
snapfull h01-upgrade-help
relaunch help update
wait 3
snapfull h02-help-update
gwlog
